msgid "Control the visible timeline range. Drag handles to zoom in/out, drag center to pan, and double-click to fit timeline. You can also use :kbd:`Ctrl+Scroll Wheel`, or on the QWidget timeline hold :kbd:`Ctrl` and drag with the middle mouse button for smooth zooming."
msgstr ""

